```

## Analysis Instructions

1. Examine the initial HTML structure
2. Identify JavaScript frameworks and libraries
3. Check if meaningful content exists in HTML
4. Assess the role of JavaScript (content vs. enhancement)
5. Consider the page type and purpose
6. Make a confident recommendation with clear reasoning
7. Provide fallback strategy for edge cases
